    <metaTag name="description">
        Test tuplets with actual- and normal-notes but without tuplet.
        This is allowed in MusicXML, but rarely used. Only seen sofar
        with output from Encore (version unknown).

        Another Encore issue is it generates rests in tuplets w/o
        either a tuplet or time-modification (see measure 2).
        </metaTag>
